  "description": "Suhan is a night school teacher whose craving for a fresh scent leads him to a local flower shop. There, he meets the charming florist Wooyoung, and they naturally begin to date. Everything seems perfect, but Suhan is hiding a secret that’s anything but floral. He is privately obsessed with a much more \"human\" aroma: the salty, lingering scent of skin after a hard day's work. As his fetish grows, Suhan struggles to keep his cool. Can a humble florist handle a lover who finds his sweat more intoxicating than his flowers?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
